Description: This repository contains the research compendium of the manuscript titled: "Hydroclimatic variability drove human-megafauna-environment interactions during the late Pleistocene/Early Holocene in central Chile" submitted to Global and Planetary Change - Journal - 2025. 
  The compendium contains all data, code, analysis and text associated with this manuscript.
